ns 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. February to March came in under 90% of normal in 35 years, the most of any pair. In 2025, July to August came in at 47% of normal and November to December at 41%. Every grid had its driest year in 2007, and grid 17273 fell to 52% of normal that year.</p>"}
